("v53", "type", "String")
("v53", "scalar", " keeps claims, evidence and review methods distinct. A claim has a stable identity and version. A method states which evidence counts, how it is weighed and what is enough to decide. The working microsite illustrates how the same evidence can produce different conclusions, with the reasons visible.")
("v52", "value", "v53")
