("v59", "type", "String")
("v59", "scalar", "Where it stands: this edition runs the story’s bounded examples through process algebra. The wider Sourcery engineering programme is a staged migration of platform and application meaning into algebra-owned sources. The examples do not establish production readiness, an independent security audit or completion of that migration.")
("v58", "value", "v59")
